title: So a dream should read the graph before writing, and a newborn's first dream should be given places to write into.
pid: 5b1fc67e-734d-434a-ba0b-a990b8621384
body: |2-
  A thing to look for, from analogy and not yet a rule. Jeff's routine
  already puts reading first and forbids restructuring while reading.
  What it does not say is where a dreamer whose graph is young should
  put what it makes; this one put each note where its title said, as
  the mission asked, and Libby will see whether that held.
contains:
- 779504f4-e803-4bf2-9354-cb1854cfa354
